@startuml
title FE-12 Evaluate Design and Produce Workshop Recommendation
actor Member
participant WorkshopRingDesignController
participant WorkshopRingDesignApplicationService
participant DesignRuleFacade
participant WorkshopRecommendation
participant WorkshopPackageDetails
participant DesignRequestController
Member -> WorkshopRingDesignController : evaluate saved design
WorkshopRingDesignController -> WorkshopRingDesignApplicationService : load owned design
WorkshopRingDesignApplicationService -> DesignRuleFacade : evaluate material, shape, stones and engraving
DesignRuleFacade --> WorkshopRingDesignApplicationService : difficulty, estimate and warnings
WorkshopRingDesignApplicationService -> WorkshopRecommendation : apply server thresholds
WorkshopRecommendation --> WorkshopRingDesignApplicationService : package, reason and advisory note
WorkshopRingDesignController --> Member : result + Recommended link + Explore workshops
alt Member follows workshop recommendation
  Member -> WorkshopPackageDetails : open recommended workshop package
else Member uses design idea for custom product
  Member -> DesignRequestController : start request with saved design reference
  DesignRequestController --> Member : human review and quote flow
end
note over Member
More than five stones recommends Silver Clay.
Difficulty above nine recommends Wax Casting
with two sessions on different days.
Recommendation does not create a booking.
Custom product purchase requires review,
approved quote and full payment.
end note
@enduml
